* GET - RESIDENT LOAD INTO MEMORY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* GET - RESIDENT LOAD INTO MEMORY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    GET hex-address filespec

Loads a file at the specified hexadecimal address without executing it. It
searches according to the configured Z-System file lookup.

This can overwrite program or resident memory. Use only in private
development on copied media. It differs completely from SYSUTLS:GET, which
redirects console input.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
